# Deliberately EMPTY, and committed.
#
# `.env` gives the built app a gateway address so a fresh device shows the register immediately.
# Under test that would make every case "connected", and most of them are about a device with a
# local draft and no gateway at all — 86 of them failed the moment `.env` appeared. Tests should
# state their own starting conditions rather than inherit the deployment's.
VITE_GATEWAY_URL=
